<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://threadbiz.example/#LessonOccurrence> .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#ownerReason> "Don't describe how the food tastes, like calling the tomatoes sweet, unless my note says so." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#recordedAt> "2026-09-24T07:54:42.446Z" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedCaption> "This week, we’re celebrating the last sweet tomatoes of the season in our vegetable and herb soup. It’s a comforting dish, perfect as the weather begins its change. Pre-order your soup for the week ahead." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedImage> "https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyMzYxOTkzODUtM2VwMDI5LmpwZWc.1c53f5f574ab3b27/1790236199385-3ep029.jpeg" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#runId> "entry-000-20260924T074921" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://threadbiz.example/#LessonOccurrence> .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <https://threadbiz.example/#ownerReason> "Don't describe how the food tastes, feels or what it does for you, like sweet, tender or nourishing, unless my note says so." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <https://threadbiz.example/#recordedAt> "2026-09-24T08:49:09.195Z" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedCaption> "This week, we're making comforting dumplings in a broth crafted from last week's saved chicken bones, a truly nourishing start to the colder weather. We're also using fresh carrots and parsley from Rosa's farm stand, whose connection we owe to Dave—it was Dave's daughter who asked for dumplings! Please pre-order your meals." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedImage> "https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyMzkzMzAyOTEtcG8yNHd3LmpwZWc.3de9c9bf759c68e1/1790239330291-po24ww.jpeg" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-002-occurrence-2> <https://threadbiz.example/#runId> "entry-006-20260924T084128" .
