<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-003-occurrence-1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://threadbiz.example/#LessonOccurrence> .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-003-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#ownerReason> "Only say what my note says about customers, like who asked for what; don't claim many people asked or that a dish is someone's favorite." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-003-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#recordedAt> "2026-09-24T08:14:06.178Z" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-003-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedCaption> "This week, we're bringing you a dish that many of you have been asking for, especially as the weather cools: slow-roasted chicken. It's a favorite of Maria's, and Dave, who just joined our table, was looking for something heartier. We've prepared a bigger batch with tender carrots, potatoes, and red onion wedges. Pre-order yours today!" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-003-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedImage> "https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyMzc0MzI5MDctaWlicDE4LmpwZWc.00e7d7a8bc20cc43/1790237432907-iibp18.jpeg" .
