<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-004-occurrence-1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://threadbiz.example/#LessonOccurrence> .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-004-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#ownerReason> "Don't say we're bringing a dish back or that we've made it before unless my note says so." .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-004-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#recordedAt> "2026-09-24T08:21:39.660Z" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-004-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedCaption> "This week, we're bringing back a dish that always feels like coming home: slow-roasted chicken with carrots, potatoes, and red onion wedges. After last week's soup sold out so quickly, Maria asked if we could bring back our roast chicken, and Dave, who heard about us from Maria, was looking for something heartier as the weather changes. We’ve made a bigger batch this time, perfect for a cozy meal. Pre-order yours today!" .
<https://threadbiz.example/#lesson-004-occurrence-1> <https://threadbiz.example/#rejectedImage> "https://agent.livepeer.org/a/aHR0cHM6Ly83eTRmbHpwdWxndjRjbzZyLnB1YmxpYy5ibG9iLnZlcmNlbC1zdG9yYWdlLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzE3OTAyMzc5OTIxMjctemxpbnRpLmpwZWc.339b10cc84be8fe3/1790237992127-zlinti.jpeg" .
